      <activity id="4d461ef5-b9c1-5a69-b052-31ec02854ba6" activityNameId="ad7222c5-376e-52d0-8695-7dc6438b2eff" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Glass cullets, sorted, at sorting plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glass cullets, sorted, at sorting plant
A production site with a production amount of 3 times 250 t/d (resulting in 266 kt per year) and a total life span of 50 a is assumed here.;
UUID: c06f3635-30f4-3fda-82da-6eef2408906d
This module includes the efforts for sorting collected glass cullets (energy, materials). No transport efforts are included for the used auxillaries.
Location: module is based on information from a Swiss and a German sorting site and valuable for European conditions
Technology: Typical technology in the middle of the 90"s in Germany and Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c06f3635-30f4-3fda-82da-6eef2408906d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
